# Anti-patterns

Never

Generate before planning

Mix audiences

Mix difficulties

Skip validation

Ignore production context

Create isolated pages

Duplicate existing content

Teach theory without practice

---

# Success Criteria

Every piece of REBASH Academy content should begin with a deliberate planning process.

The final output should feel as though an experienced engineering team first designed the learning experience and only then created the content.

Planning should become invisible to the learner but obvious in the quality of every page.